### Putting things together

$\begin{align}
&\phantom{=}\dfrac{d}{dx}\left([\ln(x)]^3)\right)
\\\\
&=\dfrac{d}{dx}\left[v\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\right]&&\gray{\text{Let }u(x)=\ln(x)\text{, }v(x)=x^3}
\\\\
&=v'\Bigl(u(x)\Bigr)\cdot u'(x)&&\gray{\text{The chain rule}}
\\\\
&=\blueD{3[\ln(x)]^2}\cdot \maroonC{\dfrac1x}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{3[\ln(x)]^2}{x}
\end{align}$
